OL,3,GNEWSAHospital issues flu jab plea as
OL,4,Acases rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn NHS trust has urged people to get a
OL,7,Fflu vaccination after recording a rise
OL,8,Fin cases.
OL,10,FEpsom and St Helier University
OL,11,FHospitals NHS Trust recorded 35 flu
OL,12,Fcases among inpatients in October,
OL,13,Fcompared with 11 recorded for the same
OL,14,Fmonth in 2025.
OL,16,FThe trust asked eligible patients to
OL,17,Fbook their free NHS jab and warned of
OL,18,Fpressure on health services.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
