OL,3,GNEWSAHospital issues flu jab plea as
OL,4,Acases rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FIts chief nurse, Tracy Luckett, said:
OL,7,F"I strongly urge anyone who's eligible
OL,8,Fto get vaccinated before flu starts
OL,9,Fspreading more widely."
